{"suttaId":"thag2.23","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[897,903],"vripara":"165"},"segments":{"thag2.23:0.4":"Sobhitattheragāthā","thag2.23:1.1":"<b>“Satimā paññavā</b> bhikkhu,","thag2.23:1.2":"āraddhabalavīriyo;","thag2.23:1.3":"Pañca kappasatānāhaṃ,","thag2.23:1.4":"ekarattiṃ anussariṃ. 166.","thag2.23:2.1":"“Cattāro satipaṭṭhāne,","thag2.23:2.2":"satta aṭṭha ca bhāvayaṃ;","thag2.23:2.3":"Pañca kappasatānāhaṃ,","thag2.23:2.4":"ekarattiṃ anussari”nti. …","thag2.23:2.5":"Sobhito thero…. 4."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Th-a-i","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a1.att","from":3847,"to":3848,"paras":[{"para":3847,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag2.23:2"],"lines":["Tattha <b>satimā</b>ti sayaṃ samudāgamanasampannāya satipaṭṭhānabhāvanāpāripūriyā sativepullappattiyā ca satimā.","<b>Paññavā</b>ti chaḷabhiññāpāripūriyā paññāvepullappattiyā ca paññavā.","Bhinnakilesatāya <b>bhikkhu</b>.","Saddhādibalānañceva catubbidhasammappadhānavīriyassa ca saṃsiddhipāripūriyā <b>āraddhabalavīriyo</b>.","Saddhādīnañhettha balaggahaṇena gahaṇaṃ satipi satiādīnaṃ balabhāve, yathā “gobalibaddhā puññañāṇasambhārā”ti.","<b>Pañca kappasatānāhaṃ, ekarattiṃ anussari</b>nti ekarattiṃ viya anussariṃ.","Viya-saddo hi idha luttaniddiṭṭho, etena pubbenivāsānussatiñāṇe attano ñāṇavasībhāvaṃ dīpeti."],"lineRefs":[["thag2.23:2"],["thag2.23:2"],["thag2.23:2"],["thag2.23:2"],["thag2.23:2"],["thag2.23:2"],["thag2.23:2"]]},{"para":3848,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag2.23:2"],"lines":["Idāni yāya paṭipattiyā attano satimantādibhāvo sātisayaṃ pubbenivāsañāṇañca siddhaṃ, taṃ dassetuṃ <b>“cattāro”</b>tiādinā dutiyaṃ gāthamāha.","Tattha <b>cattāro satipaṭṭhāne</b>ti kāyānupassanādike attano visayabhedena catubbidhe lokiyalokuttaramissake satisaṅkhāte satipaṭṭhāne.","<b>Sattā</b>ti satta bojjhaṅge.","<b>Aṭṭhā</b>ti aṭṭha maggaṅgāni.","Satipaṭṭhānesu hi suppatiṭṭhitacittassa satta bojjhaṅgā bhāvanāpāripūriṃ gatā eva honti, tathā ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo.","Tenāha dhammasenāpati –","“catūsu satipaṭṭhānesu suppatiṭṭhitacittā satta bojjhaṅge yathābhūtaṃ bhāvetvā”tiādīhi (dī. ni. 3.143) sattakoṭṭhāsikesu sattatiṃsāya bodhipakkhiyadhammesu ekasmiṃ koṭṭhāse bhāvanāpāripūriṃ gacchante itare agacchantā nāma natthīti.","<b>Bhāvaya</b>nti bhāvanāhetu.","Sesaṃ vuttanayameva."],"lineRefs":[["thag2.23:2"],["thag2.23:2"],["thag2.23:2"],["thag2.23:2"],["thag2.23:2"],["thag2.23:2"],["thag2.23:2"],["thag2.23:2"],["thag2.23:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag2.23:2.3","pañca kappasatānāhaṃ ekarattiṃ anussariṃ",0,5],["thag2.23:2.1","cattāro",1,0],["thag2.23:2.1","cattāro satipaṭṭhāne",1,1],["thag2.23:2.1","sattā",1,2],["thag2.23:2.1","aṭṭhā",1,3],["thag2.23:2.1","bhāvayaṃ",1,7]],"before":[{"para":3785,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā"]},{"para":3786,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["<b>Satimā paññavā</b>ti āyasmato sobhitattherassa gāthā.","Kā uppatti?","Ayampi purimabuddhesu katādhikāro tattha tattha bhave puññāni upacinanto padumuttarassa bhagavato kāle haṃsavatīnagare kulagehe nibbattitvā vayappatto satthu dhammadesanaṃ suṇanto satthāraṃ ekaṃ bhikkhuṃ pubbenivāsañāṇalābhīnaṃ bhikkhūnaṃ aggaṭṭhāne ṭhapentaṃ disvā sayampi taṃ ṭhānantaraṃ uddissa patthanaṃ katvā puññāni katvā sugatīsuyeva saṃsaranto sumedhassa bhagavato kāle brāhmaṇakule nibbattitvā viññutaṃ patto brāhmaṇānaṃ vijjāsippesu nipphattiṃ gantvā nekkhammādhimutto gharāvāsaṃ pahāya tāpasapabbajjaṃ pabbajitvā himavantassa samīpe araññāyatane assamaṃ kāretvā vanamūlaphalāphalena yāpento buddhuppādaṃ sutvā sabbattha ekarattivāseneva bhaddavatīnagare satthāraṃ upasaṅkamitvā pasannamānaso “tuvaṃ satthā ca ketu cā”tiādīhi chahi gāthāhi abhitthavi, satthā cassa bhāviniṃ sampattiṃ pakāsesi.","So tena puññakammena devamanussesu saṃsaranto imasmiṃ buddhuppāde sāvatthiyaṃ brāhmaṇakule nibbatti.","<b>Sobhito</b>tissa nāmaṃ akaṃsu.","So aparena samayena satthu dhammadesanaṃ sutvā paṭiladdhasaddho pabbajitvā vipassanaṃ vaḍḍhetvā chaḷabhiñño ahosi.","Pubbenivāsañāṇe ciṇṇavasī ca ahosi.","Tena vuttaṃ <b>apadāne</b> (apa. thera 2.49.46-74) –"]},{"para":3787,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Dakkhiṇe himavantassa, sukato assamo mama;"]},{"para":3788,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Uttamatthaṃ gavesanto, vasāmi vipine tadā."]},{"para":3789,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Lābhālābhena santuṭṭho, mūlena ca phalena ca;"]},{"para":3790,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Anvesanto ācariyaṃ, vasāmi ekako ahaṃ."]},{"para":3791,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Sumedho nāma sambuddho, loke uppajji tāvade;"]},{"para":3792,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Catusaccaṃ pakāseti, uddharanto mahājanaṃ."]},{"para":3793,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Nāhaṃ suṇomi sambuddhaṃ, napi me koci saṃsati;"]},{"para":3794,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Aṭṭhavasse atikkante, assosiṃ lokanāyakaṃ."]},{"para":3795,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Aggidāruṃ nīharitvā, sammajjitvāna assamaṃ;"]},{"para":3796,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Khāribhāraṃ gahetvāna, nikkhamiṃ vipinā ahaṃ."]},{"para":3797,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Ekarattiṃ vasantohaṃ, gāmesu nigamesu ca;"]},{"para":3798,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Anupubbena candavatiṃ, tadāhaṃ upasaṅkamiṃ."]},{"para":3799,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Bhagavā tamhi samaye, sumedho lokanāyako;"]},{"para":3800,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Uddharanto bahū satte, deseti amataṃ padaṃ."]},{"para":3801,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Janakāyamatikkamma, vanditvā jinasāgaraṃ;"]},{"para":3802,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Ekaṃsaṃ ajinaṃ katvā, santhaviṃ lokanāyakaṃ."]},{"para":3803,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tuvaṃ satthā ca ketu ca, dhajo yūpo ca pāṇinaṃ;"]},{"para":3804,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Parāyano patiṭṭhā ca, dīpo ca dvipaduttamo."]},{"para":3805,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Nepuñño dassane vīro, tāresi janataṃ tuvaṃ;"]},{"para":3806,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Natthañño tārako loke, tavuttaritaro mune."]},{"para":3807,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Sakkā theve kusaggena, pametuṃ sāgaruttame;"]},{"para":3808,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Na tveva tava sabbaññu, ñāṇaṃ sakkā pametave."]},{"para":3809,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tuladaṇḍe ṭhapetvāna, mahiṃ sakkā dharetave;"]},{"para":3810,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Natveva tava paññāya, pamāṇamatthi cakkhuma."]},{"para":3811,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Ākāso minituṃ sakkā, rajjuyā aṅgulena vā;"]},{"para":3812,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Natveva tava sabbaññu, sīlaṃ sakkā pametave."]},{"para":3813,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Mahāsamudde udakaṃ, ākāso ca vasundharā;"]},{"para":3814,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Parimeyyāni etāni, appameyyosi cakkhuma."]},{"para":3815,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Chahi gāthāhi sabbaññuṃ, kittayitvā mahāyasaṃ;"]},{"para":3816,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Añjaliṃ paggahetvāna, tuṇhī aṭṭhāsahaṃ tadā."]},{"para":3817,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Yaṃ vadanti sumedhoti, bhūripaññaṃ sumedhasaṃ;"]},{"para":3818,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Bhikkhusaṅghe nisīditvā, imā gāthā abhāsatha."]},{"para":3819,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Yo me ñāṇaṃ pakittesi, vippasannena cetasā;"]},{"para":3820,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Tamahaṃ kittayissāmi, suṇātha mama bhāsato."]},{"para":3821,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Sattasattati kappāni, devaloke ramissati;"]},{"para":3822,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sahassakkhattuṃ devindo, devarajjaṃ karissati."]},{"para":3823,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Anekasatakkhattuñca, cakkavattī bhavissati;"]},{"para":3824,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ."]},{"para":3825,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Devabhūto manusso vā, puññakammasamāhito;"]},{"para":3826,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Anūnamanasaṅkappo, tikkhapañño bhavissati."]},{"para":3827,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tiṃsakappasahassamhi, okkākakulasambhavo;"]},{"para":3828,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati."]},{"para":3829,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Agārā abhinikkhamma, pabbajissatikiñcano;"]},{"para":3830,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Jātiyā sattavassena, arahattaṃ phusissati."]},{"para":3831,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Yato sarāmi attānaṃ, yato pattosmi sāsanaṃ;"]},{"para":3832,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Etthantare na jānāmi, cetanaṃ amanoramaṃ."]},{"para":3833,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Saṃsaritvā bhave sabbe, sampattānubhaviṃ ahaṃ;"]},{"para":3834,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Bhoge me ūnatā natthi, phalaṃ ñāṇassa thomane."]},{"para":3835,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tiyaggī nibbutā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;"]},{"para":3836,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sabbāsavā parikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo."]},{"para":3837,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Tiṃsakappasahassamhi, yaṃ ñāṇamathaviṃ ahaṃ;"]},{"para":3838,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, phalaṃ ñāṇassa thomane."]},{"para":3839,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ…pe… kataṃ buddhassa sāsana”nti."]},{"para":3840,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["So arahattaṃ pana patvā attano pubbenivāsaṃ anupaṭipāṭiyā anussaranto yāva asaññabhave acittakapaṭisandhi, tāva addasa.","Tato pañca kappasatāni cittappavattiṃ adisvā avasāneva disvā “kimeta”nti āvajjento nayavasena “asaññabhavo bhavissatī”ti niṭṭhaṃ agamāsi.","Tenāha bhagavā –","“atthi, bhikkhave, asaññasattā nāma dīghāyukā devā, tato cuto sobhito idhūpapanno, so etaṃ bhavaṃ jānāti, sobhito anussaratī”ti (pārā. 232 atthato samānaṃ).","Evaṃ nayavasena anussarantassa anussaraṇakosallaṃ disvā satthā theraṃ pubbenivāsaṃ anussarantānaṃ aggaṭṭhāne ṭhapesi.","Tato eva cāyaṃ āyasmā savisesaṃ attano pubbenivāsānussatiñāṇaṃ tassa ca paccayabhūtaṃ paṭipattiṃ paccavekkhitvā somanassajāto tadatthadīpanaṃ udānaṃ udānento – 165."]},{"para":3842,"vripara":"165","title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Satimā paññavā bhikkhu, āraddhabalavīriyo;"]},{"para":3843,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Pañca kappasatānāhaṃ, ekarattiṃ anussariṃ. 166."]},{"para":3845,"vripara":"166","title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Cattāro satipaṭṭhāne, satta aṭṭha ca bhāvayaṃ;"]},{"para":3846,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Pañca kappasatānāhaṃ, ekarattiṃ anussari”nti. –","gāthādvayaṃ abhāsi;"]}],"after":[{"para":3849,"vripara":null,"title":"Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sobhitattheragāthāvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 4."]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
